sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant QP as Questrade Portal
    participant Agent as AI Agent (Claude/Copilot/Gemini)
    participant Engine as QuestradeDataEngine.py
    participant KC as macOS Keychain
    participant CF as .questrade_cache
    participant QAuth as Questrade OAuth2 API

    Note over U, QP: Phase 1: User generates one-week app token (manual, ~2 min)
    U->>QP: Visit apphub.questrade.com → Generate Token
    QP-->>U: One-week application token string
    U->>Agent: "Here is my token: <token>"

    Note over Agent, QAuth: Phase 2: Agent redeems token (automated)
    Agent->>QAuth: POST /oauth2/token?refresh_token=<one_week_token> -d ''
    QAuth-->>Agent: HTTP 200 → { refresh_token, access_token, api_server }

    Note over Agent, KC: Phase 3: Secure encryption (ADR 019)
    Agent->>Engine: python3 QuestradeDataEngine.py --seed "<refresh_token>" --cache-dir investment_screener/backend/
    Engine->>KC: keyring.get_password("InvestmentToolkit", "QuestradeMasterKey")

    alt First run — no key yet
        Engine->>Engine: Generate 256-bit AES master key
        Engine->>KC: keyring.set_password(...) → stored in hardware enclave
    else Key already exists
        KC-->>Engine: Return hex-encoded master key
    end

    Engine->>Engine: AES-256-GCM encrypt refresh_token (Nonce + Ciphertext)

    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
        Note right of Engine: Phase 4: Atomic write (ADR 015)
        Engine->>CF: Write encrypted payload to .questrade_cache.tmp
        Engine->>CF: os.replace(.tmp → .questrade_cache)
        Note right of CF: Binary noise only — no plaintext on disk
    end

    Note over Agent: Phase 5: Agent verifies via API
    Agent->>Agent: POST /api/portfolio/sync-questrade
    Agent-->>U: ✅ Sync successful — setup complete
